{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0439A0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"刚才说的Nahuelito是什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"是生活在阿根廷纳韦尔瓦皮湖的蛇颈龙。虽然目击证词各不相同，但我觉得基本上和Nessie是同一种生物。不过……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":153,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不过？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"有一种说法认为，Nahuelito是受50年代核试验影响而诞生的……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"核试验？没有记录显示50年代阿根廷进行过核试验。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"当时军人出身的胡安·庇隆总统正推动快速工业化。在他因政变下台之前，就算秘密进行过实验也不足为奇。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":143,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"听起来有点牵强。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"是吗？那这么说，Nahuelito果然是恐龙？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"我可没这么说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"Nahuelito原来是幸存下来的恐龙……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"不……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"谢谢你，Boss！多亏你，我终于确信了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""}]}